Third-party code
----------------

src/typos/ (mod.rs and hide.rs) is a port of AutoWikiBrowser's typo fixing:
WikiFunctions/Parse/RegExTypoFix.cs, the HideMore part of
WikiFunctions/Parse/HideText.cs, and regular expressions from
WikiFunctions/WikiRegexes.cs.

    RegExTypoFix.cs: Copyright (C) 2007 Martin Richards & Max Semenik
    WikiRegexes.cs:  Copyright (C) 2007 Martin Richards
    HideText.cs:     the AutoWikiBrowser contributors

AutoWikiBrowser is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2
or (at your option) any later version, and this port is distributed under
version 3 of that license, as the original permits.
https://sourceforge.net/projects/autowikibrowser/
